title DevOps Incident Management System - HLD v2
direction right

Clients [icon: users] {
  Users [icon: users, label: "Users: On-Call, Commander, Scribe, Svc Owner, Eng Mgr, Admin, Auditor"]
  WebApp [icon: react, label: "Web App (React)"]
  Monitoring [icon: prometheus, label: "Monitoring (Prometheus / Grafana)"]
  GitHubActions [icon: github-actions, label: "GitHub Actions (deploy events)"]
}

Edge [icon: shield] {
  Nginx [icon: server, label: "nginx (TLS, reverse proxy, rate limit)"]
  Security [icon: lock, label: "Spring Security (auth check on every request)"]
}

Core Services [icon: server] {
  Auth [icon: key-round, label: "Auth Service"]
  AlertIngestion [icon: inbox, label: "Alert Ingestion (validate, dedup)"]
  Incident [icon: siren, label: "Incident Service (core)", color: orange]
  Timeline [icon: scroll-text, label: "Timeline and Audit (append-only)"]
  Catalog [icon: calendar-clock, label: "Catalog and On-Call"]
  Reporting [icon: bar-chart-3, label: "Reporting and Search"]
  Escalation [icon: alarm-clock, label: "Escalation Worker (polls every 1 min)"]
  Relay [icon: repeat, label: "Outbox Relay (publish, retry)"]
}

Database [icon: database] {
  Postgres [icon: postgresql, label: "PostgreSQL (schema per service)"]
  Outbox [icon: archive, label: "outbox table (written in the same transaction)"]
}

StatusPage [icon: globe, label: "Status Page (optional)"]

Event Bus [icon: rabbitmq] {
  Exchange [icon: rabbitmq, label: "incident-events exchange (RabbitMQ, fan-out)"]
  QInApp [icon: list, label: "in-app-notifications"]
  QEmail [icon: list, label: "email-slack"]
  QLive [icon: list, label: "live-updates"]
  QAI [icon: list, label: "ai-jobs"]
  DLQ [icon: trash-2, label: "DLQ (failed msgs, all queues)"]
}

Async Workers [icon: cpu] {
  NotifWorker [icon: bell, label: "Notification Worker (in-app, idempotent by event ID)"]
  Sender [icon: send, label: "External Sender (rate-limited)"]
  WSPusher [icon: radio, label: "WebSocket Pusher (live updates to Web App)"]
  AI [icon: bot, label: "AI Assistant (optional)"]
}

External [icon: plug] {
  SlackEmail [icon: slack, label: "Slack / Email"]
  Redis [icon: redis, label: "Redis (optional, pub/sub)"]
  Ollama [icon: brain, label: "Ollama (local LLM)"]
}

Legend [icon: info] {
  LegendSync [icon: arrow-right, label: "Solid arrow = sync call"]
  LegendAsync [icon: more-horizontal, label: "Dotted arrow = async via event bus"]
  LegendOutbox [icon: archive, label: "Events commit with the change, then the relay publishes"]
}

Users > WebApp
WebApp > Nginx: /api
Monitoring > Nginx: alerts (/webhooks/alerts)
GitHubActions > Nginx: deploys
Nginx > Security
Security > Core Services: routes

AlertIngestion > Incident: create/link
Incident > Timeline: same transaction
Incident - Catalog: get on-call

Core Services > Postgres
Escalation > Postgres: poll deadlines

Incident > Outbox: event, same transaction
Escalation > Outbox: event, same transaction
Relay > Outbox: read unpublished
Relay --> Exchange: publish
Incident --> StatusPage: approved updates

Exchange --> QInApp
Exchange --> QEmail
Exchange --> QLive
Exchange --> QAI

QInApp --> DLQ: on failure
QEmail --> DLQ: on failure
QLive --> DLQ: on failure
QAI --> DLQ: on failure

QInApp --> NotifWorker
QEmail --> Sender
QLive --> WSPusher
QAI --> AI

NotifWorker > Postgres: write notification
Sender > SlackEmail
WSPusher > Redis
AI > Ollama
